.TH tuclass n 0.2 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tuclass
.PP
Parses a Mermaid \fBclassDiagram\fR block into a \fBtclutils::tudiagram\fR model so it renders natively (SVG or PNG) through the pure\-Tcl engine. One of the graph\-type parsers the \fBtclutils::tuflow\fR facade dispatches to; normally call \fBtuflow::toPng\fR / \fBtuflow::toSvg\fR.
.SS Package
.CS
package require tclutils::tuclass 0.2
.CE
.SS Commands
.CS
::tclutils::tuclass::parse text      ;# -> tudiagram model dict
.CE
.SS "Supported syntax (Mermaid subset)"
.CS
class X {                   -> box with three compartments
    +int a                     (name / attributes / methods, separated by a
    +m()                       dashed line; members with "()" are methods)
}
class X { +int a; +m() }    -> the same block on one line, ";" between members
class X { }                 -> a class without members (the block is closed)
X : +int a                  -> member added outside a block
X : +m()
A <|-- B                    -> edge B->A labelled "extends" (B inherits A)
A *-- B / A o-- B / A ..> B -> labelled edge (composition / aggregation / dependency)
A <|-- B : label            -> an explicit label wins
A "1" --> "*" B : label     -> cardinality strings are accepted and dropped;
                               the edge A->B stays
.CE
.PP
Members written in front of a closing \fB}\fR still count (\fB+m() }\fR).
.SS Usage
.CS
package require tclutils::tuclass
package require tclutils::tudiagram

set src {classDiagram
    Animal <|-- Dog
    class Animal {
        +String name
        +makeSound()
    }
    class Dog {
        +fetch()
    }
}
::tclutils::tudiagram::writePng [::tclutils::tuclass::parse $src] class.png -scale 3
.CE
.SS Notes
.IP \(bu
v1 limitations (honest): compartments use a dashed separator line, not drawn box dividers; UML arrowheads (hollow triangle, diamond) are not drawn — the relationship kind is shown as an edge label instead; cardinality strings (\fB1\fR, \fB*\fR) are parsed but not drawn (the model has no field for them).
.IP \(bu
Companion: \fBtclutils::tudiagram\fR (renderer), \fBtclutils::tuflow\fR (dispatch).
.SS "Error codes"
.PP
\fB\-errorcode {TCLUTILS TUCLASS <REASON>}\fR — \fBEMPTY\fR (no classes found).
